_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ylvbDPVeuW8Q7kNvwHFQXc3&_nc_oc=AdpEEJ_YsN3m5sMFciU_4ty5HkSJGwOwC7EyjsPNWUGsx46D_TM7nB9bO12-u6kNguw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=wyu_iPSWXUktIJlHpabRNw&_nc_ss=70a8c&oh=00_AQPtkmzaR0Zh6VbTZ_k61SnHmUgKv1Qe1XhgEc1Eqk38Hg&oe=6ACF64BC", "width": 1080, "height": 1080, "id": "11", "resolution": "1080x1080"}, {"url": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/742473244_18603073336032877_149178433455889535_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=MzkzODM4MjYzMDMxMDM4NTM5MTE4NjAzMDczMzMzMDMyODc3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ylvbDPVeuW8Q7kNvwHFQXc3&_nc_oc=AdpEEJ_YsN3m5sMFciU_4ty5HkSJGwOwC7EyjsPNWUGsx46D_TM7nB9bO12-u6kNguw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=wyu_iPSWXUktIJlHpabRNw&_nc_ss=70a8c&oh=00_AQM7EdPUm9G0qhgv6mpxg283ZLPkuTto0B0oeE-Mz-yGeQ&oe=6ACF64BC", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "id": "12", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "bah_mo", "author_id": "1409386550", "id": "18116031139786052", "text": "So whats the difference between sensation and emotion?", "timestamp": 1790142765, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ryanthomasgrowth", "author_id": "26015122821", "id": "18105516863071197", "text": "I like this. Emotions (can't remember who said this Emotion = energy in motion). In short, you're saying change your relationship to the emotions so that you can transmute that energy (emotion) into something expansive instead of internally destructive. (also...when you said \"palms are sweaty\" all I heard next was \"knees weak, arms are heavy\" lol)", "timestamp": 1789694011, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "anthoniapichel", "author_id": "8215147277", "id": "18116065981993574", "text": "YOU CAN CONTROL YOUR EMOTIONS!", "timestamp": 1789466651, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "nslchiq", "author_id": "64211523867", "id": "17898138912598930", "text": "I would say the feelings that are assigned are ok and that we should still acknowledge the feelings that we've assigned with our brains as a collective knowingness (because we don't want to lie to ourselves); but instead say not to assign judgement to those feelings.", "timestamp": 1789224869, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sunofman", "author_id": "276714419", "id": "18104883662595094", "text": "Naw. Disagree. I explain both in my book “UNDERSTAND TRAUMA and SELF DEFENSE MECHANISMS”\n\nThe emotion is a function that is apart of the brain. Feeling is the electrical signals our nervous system produced from its contact with external stimulus. \nEmotion is where feelings go to be processed.", "timestamp": 1789065687, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "groundofpeace", "author_id": "63148239039", "id": "18095202692205981", "text": "Grateful for your perspective. I am here to share my perspective and perhaps it will align with yours. My theory, emotions are an energy source code that is directly connected to the nervous system. How we react the source code when it presents itself solidifies the programming into our body/being. Then our nervous system becomes programmed to respond through its programmed reaction when the emotional code appears.  A different example of utilizing feelings with emotions is to see feelings as sensory stimulus/signals. Usually a feeling is an internal response to an external stimulus.  There is no separation between feelings and emotions within a time frame. It happens simultaneously in constant communication moving in synchronicity between a synaptic wave. The emotion or feeling can happen at the exact moment of a thought, external influence such as sounds and words, or through any of the body’s senses. This part of my study becomes deep and profoundly interesting. Trauma is a block personally inflicted upon self to navigate through the world without utilizing the full spectrum of emotional source code material. It’s like stopping the sensation because it didn’t align with the external environment so numbness to that area made more “sense” to apply to continue being in the dimension that was presented. The idea now here is to call upon those traumas, recognize and release the blockages, utilize the senses to the max. MAx in the experience. Call emotional intelligence from source code, feel the frequency, align with true self and utilize your ability and power to full and beyonder potential. Which we now are.", "timestamp": 1788873542, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "maniinwa313", "author_id": "37262555791", "id": "17991063095845202", "text": "Amin 🦾👊🏿", "timestamp": 1788863058, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "infyzo", "author_id": "2306983673", "id": "17958590004197382", "text": "Not true", "timestamp": 1788803887, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "surrender.diaries", "author_id": "77859078900", "id": "18103019879194618", "text": "❤️🙌", "timestamp": 1788632065, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "esogetic_wizard", "author_id": "362514990", "id": "18084047051284297", "text": "Actually you can control your emotions. Meditation can crystallize your reactionary tendencies.", "timestamp": 1788537789, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gardien_dla_nuit", "author_id": "488068332", "id": "18141947218569227", "text": "Feelings and emotions are actually samething . Frequency is a cycle , an occurrence of an energy ( body vibration 👉🏿 emotion - energy in Motion )", "timestamp": 1788142136, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_topadalyne_", "author_id": "46096655984", "id": "17868202392649455", "text": "What is this stud talking about 😂", "timestamp": 1788111188, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "igorchakxyz", "author_id": "18191266", "id": "18103001810221123", "text": "this is nonsense. Feelings are objective raw signals that your body produces. Emotions are metaphorical, a story over a raw signal interpretation.", "timestamp": 1788025664, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "iamtiffaniedixon", "author_id": "442578452", "id": "18085065824263580", "text": "Not totally True", "timestamp": 1788021239, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dan8iLFOBbv/", "webpage_url_basename": "Dan8iLFOBbv", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/742473244_18603073336032877_149178433455889535_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=MzkzODM4MjYzMDMxMDM4NTM5MTE4NjAzMDczMzMzMDMyODc3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ylvbDPVeuW8Q7kNvwHFQXc3&_nc_oc=AdpEEJ_YsN3m5sMFciU_4ty5HkSJGwOwC7EyjsPNWUGsx46D_TM7nB9bO12-u6kNguw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=wyu_iPSWXUktIJlHpabRNw&_nc_ss=70a8c&oh=00_AQM7EdPUm9G0qhgv6mpxg283ZLPkuTto0B0oeE-Mz-yGeQ&oe=6ACF64BC", "display_id": "Dan8iLFOBbv", "fulltitle": "Video by drcoachrees", "upload_date": "20260710", "epoch": 1791589514, "format": "dash-2209109336579377v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-1048689784354431a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2209109336579377v+dash-1048689784354431a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 510.358, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 454.571, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 55.787, "asr": 48000, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.08.19", "release_git_head": "594bd50c2c78ac432f81600d309fdc4e0a92d82c", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}